402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (At Black Founders Network, our mission is clear: to create an inclusive community for Black innovators at all stages of their journeys; providing them with the networks, resources and inspiration to launch, fund or join impactful companies. We are dedicated to providing a supportive ecosystem that empowers individuals with the networks, resources, and inspiration needed to launch, fund, or join impactful companies. Our commitment extends to fostering an environment where Black excellence is recognized, celebrated, and amplified.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
