404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 124 0 R
/E (Our vision is to cultivate a thriving community of Black founders and Black-led startups, from every industry and every stage. We envision a landscape where diversity is not just a goal but a lived reality, where the collective strength of Black entrepreneurs propels them to the forefront of innovation and success.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
